    "body": "Four links in the first Supported Profile Formats table pointed to stale paths under docs/ (underscore-style) that no longer exist. Updated them to the current docs/how-to/ paths:\r\n\r\n- docs/generate_perf_report.md → docs/how-to/generate-perf-report-pytorch.md\r\n- docs/jax_analyses.md → docs/how-to/generate-perf-report-jax.md\r\n- docs/generate_perf_report_rocprof.md → docs/how-to/generate-perf-report-rocprof.md\r\n- docs/generate_perf_report_rocprof_pftrace.md → docs/how-to/generate-perf-report-rocprof.md\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nCopyright (c) 2025 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. All rights reserved.\r\n\r\nSee LICENSE for license information.\r\n-->\r\n",
